Version 2.0.

Modifications and enhancements by fatidaprilian (https://github.com/fatidaprilian/evtraw):
- Added dedicated Input Device Configuration (IDC) for FocalTech (fts_ts) touch digitizer on Poco F4 (munch).
- Adjusted maximum event dispatch rate to 360 events/second to match native 360Hz hardware touch polling capability.
- Removed hardware blacklists and installation abort routines.
- Updated driver sysfs and ioctl tuning routines for Xiaomi and universal touch controllers.
- Refactored documentation and installation workflows to adhere to standard technical specifications without emojis.
